---
---

<section id="about" class="py-24 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold tracking-widest text-xs uppercase">Vision &amp; Parcours</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">À propos de mon parcours</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg">
        L'alliance de l'excellence académique en Master et de la pratique continue du terrain en entreprise.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Pillars Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
      
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Master MIASHS ICE-LD</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Actuellement en <strong>Master MIASHS ICE-LD</strong> à l'Université de Toulouse, je me spécialise dans la conception d'architectures distribuées, la gestion de données massives et le management des systèmes d'information.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-semibold">
            Rythme : 2 sem école / 5 sem entreprise
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-cyan-500/30 bg-gradient-to-b from-cyan-500/5 to-transparent">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Alternance chez Semware</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            En poste chez <strong>Semware</strong>, j'interviens sur la gestion de projets informatiques et le développement d'applications logicielles, en veillant à la qualité du code, au respect des jalons et à la satisfaction client.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-300 text-xs font-semibold">
            Alternance en cours • Semware
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="glass-card rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="size-12 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Synergie Tech &amp; Management</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Comprendre les contraintes techniques du code (architecture, API, sécurité) tout en traduisant les besoins métiers (méthode Agile Scrum, reporting PowerBI, documentation et passation d'équipe).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10">
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 text-xs font-semibold">
            Chef de projet orienté résultats
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Banner Alternance -->
    <div class="glass-card rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 border-blue-500/30 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900/20 via-purple-900/20 to-slate-900/40 flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start lg:items-center justify-between gap-8">
      <div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-purple-400">Expérience &amp; Savoir-Faire</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Un profil complet pour vos défis numériques</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Avec des expériences concrètes chez <strong>Semware</strong>, au <strong>CNRS</strong> et chez <strong>Egerine</strong>, je mets en pratique les méthodes agiles et les technologies modernes pour concevoir des applications durables.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="size-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Alternant chez Semware
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="size-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Master MIASHS ICE-LD
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="size-4 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
            Expérience CNRS &amp; Egerine
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a 
        href="#contact" 
        class="whitespace-nowrap px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 hover:bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 font-bold text-sm transition-all shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20"
      >
        Me contacter
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
